{"version":1,"key":"card:774","content":{"id":774,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"048e5bf3-0d65-4d6a-9e0a-c035e106cb53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在日常经济活动中，借钱、买卖、租赁等行为都会让一方有权要求另一方做某件事，这种「可以要求对方做事」的权利，在法律上被称为债权。具体来说，债权是债权人根据法律或合同，有权要求债务人做某件事或者不做某件事的权利。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e35ca9cf-bd1f-4f3b-a637-d145a629bbdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当这种请求权的内容具体指向「支付一定金额的货币」时，就构成了货币债权。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/openai-image-1-1782999988130_64d6d4a5-ab3f-4ef4-8f0e-d498e59a192a.webp","alt":"货币债权示意图","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/openai-image-1-1782999988130_64d6d4a5-ab3f-4ef4-8f0e-d498e59a192a.webp","width":369,"naturalWidth":1254,"naturalHeight":1254,"description":"","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"d82de608-a0c4-4fe4-b06e-d27496a5997e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"813797f7-2f8a-4bed-adfe-9274fb0f0044","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如借款合同中出借人要求借款人还钱的权利，买卖合同中卖方要求买方付款的权利，都属于典型的货币债权。"}]}],"tags":["经济/货币债权"],"createTime":1782999527548,"updateTime":1792804298905,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792804298905}}